WEBVTT

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.330
You're really working hard, Kinjou!

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:43.460
Yeah, it's almost the In-High after all.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.830
I'll be right back. Have to prepare.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.210
Prepare?

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.750
For today's practice.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.130
That's right, Makishima.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.260
What is it?

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.050
As fellow climbers, make sure you get along.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:56.760
Eh?

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.720
He's a bit odd, but I'm counting on you.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.850
Onoda Sakamichi

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:38.680
G-good afternoon.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.510
Get changed quickly!

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.470
Ah, that's right. Yes!

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:48.400
Shoes

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:49.310
Gloves

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:50.520
Cyclocomputer

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:51.360
Bottle

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:54.110
And Manyu Manyu!! -doesn't belong!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.360
What's that?

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:03.040
S-sorry! Yes!

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:06.040
I shouldn't be bringing unnecessary items into the club room, right? Yes!

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.250
Ah well

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.670
Umm... well yesterday, I wondered if I might get lucky and get a
rare one, and then it actually happened... I was just so happy

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.880
I ended up just sticking it into my bag like that, s-sorry!!

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.600
Crap, I made him start cowering again.

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:26.480
As fellow climbers, make sure you get along.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:29.730
Better try to get closer to him.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.440
That's, um, that thing.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:37.530
An anime's, I think, the one with a really detailed 3D structure?

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:43.580
Eh, so, where's it from?

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.620
ARE YOU INTERESTED?!

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:52.790
Shall I open it?

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:54.210
It's a really special one!

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:58.470
No, you don't.. it's fine, so just put it away...

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.260
He opened it!!

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:03.600
Here, please, look at the detail in these parts!

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:07.560
There's an established opinion that the details in this
prototype are reproduced from a southern sea temple.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:13.770
Here I go!

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.270
Ah? Sure...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.110
Please look!

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:24.700
The holes where the right and left arms go have different shapes.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:26.410
And this coating is also so detailed!!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:30.620
Just look at the gradation on the head! It's so faithful to the original work!

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.880
I don't get what you're saying at all...

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:38.340
So there's this anime called Manyu Manyu and well,
the original work was a game but

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:42.010
Look! This is the gradation on the head I was referring to!

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:44.050
I have no idea what you mean...

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.600
Anyway, this is a character called Black Manyu that appears in that anime.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:51.480
I worked really, really hard to get it!

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:56.270
Why is it only at times like these that there's
never anyone else in the club room?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.530
Come on, Tadokorocchi, hurry!

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.950
Come on, come on, come onnnn.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.620
I'll get something to eat at the cafeteria first after all.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.330
He turned back!!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:08.990
What's wrong?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:13.750
Ah, nothing, it's just a bird, a huge bird just flew off.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.380
More importantly, look over here!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.630
In the world of Manyu Manyu, the Black Manyu is

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:20.130
He's continuing?!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:22.970
Huh?

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.550
No choice left...

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.810
Better call Teshima and Aoyagi over.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.190
Crap, he saw me!

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.520
Ah, no, it's not like that.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:39.820
Here, go ahead.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.610
If you wanted to take a picture, you should have just said so!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:47.870
I completely understand that feeling! This is a super rare item after all!

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.750
What's with this picture?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.500
'Scuse me!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:04.220
Kinjou, this is good enough, right?

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:12.310
Wow, what a great picture! It's something you
don't see very often, so please treasure it!

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.350
'Sup, Naruko's coming in!

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:18.150
Hey, It's Imaizumi!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.860
Why did you guys take so long to get here?! Time to head to practice!!

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.410
Uwaa, Makishima-san is pissed!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:27.990
Better get changed quickly.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:42.550
Practice is starting.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:43.550
Yes!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.220
What are you doing? Let's go, Onoda-kun!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:48.930
Right!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:01.610
What's this?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.500
Good work, guys!

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.090
Onoda-kun, how's your condition?

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.260
I'm doing great! Yup!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:30.090
That guy, was he always this high tension?

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.520
Ah? Hm? Huh?

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:38.890
What's wrong?

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.060
Ah, nothing, um...

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:45.820
For today's menu, we'll have each of the grade
years go separately and climb Minegayama.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:47.860
The course for the Inter High is Hakone.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.820
The team that controls the slopes will be the team to achieve victory.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:57.160
While monitoring your breathing and heart
rate, make sure you pace yourself as well.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:58.000
Yes!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.720
Let's start with the 2nd years.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.590
Teshima, Aoyagi, ready to go?

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:13.600
Yes!

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:14.930
Start!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:28.690
Next, the 1st years. Imaizumi, Naruko, Onoda, you're up next!

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:29.570
Yes!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.070
I'm not gonna lose!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.740
This isn't a race.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:38.410
What's that? No confidence? Well then, go ahead
and take your time getting there, hot shot.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.830
Even if I left after you, I'd still take the top!

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:42.880
What's that?!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.540
1st years, start!

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:46.590
Here we go!

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:58.810
Those three are the key to this In-High.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.060
Yeah!

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.400
Alright, the three of us should start as well.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:04.310
Yup!

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:06.860
What's that?

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.480
Ah, nothing!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.320
Kanzaki-senpai

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.240
Yo!

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:17.620
Onii-chan!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.490
I brought supplies.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.250
Thank you very much.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:22.710
Sorry for having to do this every time.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.880
It's no problem. You guys go ahead and go!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.130
Yosssh!!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:38.470
Back when I was captain, Kinjou, Makishima, and Tadokoro were
all adorable 1st years, but now they're almost beyond recognition.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:40.720
Ah, Miki, hop in with your friend!

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:41.390
Right!

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.770
I'm in the lead!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:53.740
Why are you suddenly dashing ahead? Remember
what the captain said? Pace yourself!

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:02.960
Yeah, well why don't you pace yourself?!
I'm not letting you take the lead!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:05.040
The winner is always the red one!

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:09.210
Geez, you really love standing out! A race
is something you do with a cool head.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.260
You need to stand out in cycling!

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:25.190
Both Imaizumi-kun and Naruko-kun are so fast!

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:34.990
Both Imaizumi and Naruko are really getting worked up!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.450
It's a good thing!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:42.950
Can they race only on tension? These brats still have a
lot to do. I'll show them what a real race looks like!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:01.220
Old man?

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.810
Don't call me old man!

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.030
There he goes, the rampaging human bullet!

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.410
Onii-chan, what about work?

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.040
It's fine as long as I get back to the store by evening.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.920
Put some effort into it!

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:37.840
Kanzaki-san

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.510
Onoda-kun, it's too soon to be worn out! Go for it!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:43.680
Go, go!

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:46.270
Yes

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:20.680
What? What happened? Is he dropping out?

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:21.800
Onoda-kun...

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.800
S-stop the car, Onii-chan!

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:35.070
What are you doing?

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:36.280
Um

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.990
Did you start to feel ill?

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:39.280
No

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.740
So, what is it?

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:43.450
I lost something.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.540
Something very important.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.830
Did you drop your wallet?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.500
No, not my wallet.

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:52.420
Your house key?

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:53.380
No

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:54.920
Commuter pass?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:55.540
No

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.210
Um

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.800
Uh... um, Makishima-san, just a sec.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:11.980
You see, actually, I brought a sticker with me
that I was planning on putting on my bike.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.810
A sticker?

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.230
An Oritsugun sticker.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.650
What's that?

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:24.200
It was this year's biggest hit, an original robot anime! It's a really
valuable sticker that I lined up for 3 hours at an event to buy!

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.240
Like I would know.

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:28.490
I may never get my hands on another one...

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:35.130
And yet I accidentally dropped it somewhere... I think it might
have been back in the club room before heading to practice.

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:41.720
Ah! Maybe... is it this?

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.220
T-t-tha that's it!!

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:50.520
Um, I could lose it again, so is it alright if I put it on my bike before I do?

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:52.770
Eh? Sure!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:59.190
Ah! Could it be? Maybe, makishima-san,
you really, really wanted this sticker?

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:00.190
Huh?

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:03.240
And when you picked it up by chance, you thought "lucky!"?

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.780
I thought no such thing!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.910
I'll be going to another anime event pretty soon,
so I'll bring you something next time!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:14.210
I don't need anything! besides, I'm only interested in gravure...

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.680
Alright, I'll head back to practice now!

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:26.260
Ah? Right...

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:30.760
What a relief!

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.180
What is it?

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:34.430
Nothing. Ah?

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:38.810
We should be going too.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:42.150
Well, I guess this is also a way to get close.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:58.380
Hm?

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:02.880
That guy...!

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.170
He caught up to us!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.180
Interesting!!

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:43.300
There he goes, the peak Spider!

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:54.720
That hotshot! Here I go too!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.960
What's with him? Suddenly he's in high spirits...

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.750
Yup! It's because Onoda-kun's a climber!

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:27.260
A climber?

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:30.180
A rider whose specialty is climbing hills.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.930
Onoda Sakamichi... huh?

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:40.810
There they are!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:01.830
Who's going to take the top?

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.840
Makishima-san!

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:14.970
Shiiiiit!

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.810
Good work, guys!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:22.520
Thanks!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:23.900
Here you go!

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:25.230
Thanks!

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:30.530
Imaizumi, switch with me!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:32.570
Ah, sure!

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:35.700
Thanks

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.460
U-um

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.590
Ah, this is that thing...

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:51.510
Black Manyu

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:57.640
Thank you so much!!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.890
You think they managed to get closer to each other?

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:03.480
Maybe

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.230
I'm looking forward to Hakone!

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:08.520
Yeah

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:23.790
2 more minutes!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.510
1 minute!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.220
You're not being loud enough, 1st years!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:33.920
Yes!

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:35.840
And don't close your eyes.

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:37.090
Observe their forms carefully.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:37.890
Yes!

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:41.270
This is the riding style of Japan's fastest team.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:48.770
Time over!!

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:54.990
Abs, abs, abs!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.160
Where's Manami?

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.370
Riding in the mountains, isn't he?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:00.620
Haaa?

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:24.980
I never thought we'd have a 1st year regular though.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:29.190
Speaking of, seems like Souhoku has 1st year members too.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.230
Haaa?

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:31.860
Plus, there are three of them!

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.070
What are they, stupid?

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:39.110
It doesn't matter if they are 1st or 2nd years.
The strong ones race and win.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.200
And... I am strong!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.250
I'll definitely stand out in the In-High!

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:52.790
I will...

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:56.470
Defeat him!!

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:06.270
I wonder who will win this summer.
